                "A": "6",
                "B": "10",
                "C": "14",
                "D": "20"
              },
              "answer": "C",
              "hint": "For division by x − a, the remainder is f(a).",
              "hintZh": "除以 x − a 的餘式為 f(a)。",
              "solution": "By the remainder theorem, f(2) = 2(2³) − 3(2) + 4 = 14.",
              "solutionZh": "由餘式定理，f(2) = 2(2³) − 3(2) + 4 = 14。",
              "source": "EAC original practice",
              "sourceZh": "EAC 原創練習",
              "level": "free"
